":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014602","helmet":"WP1013502"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1019","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[48,26,69,65,78,58],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014602","helmet":"WP1013502"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1019","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[48,26,69,65,78,58],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014602","helmet":"WP1013502"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1028","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[48,26,69,65,78,58],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014602","helmet":"WP1013502"},"couple":["WJ10050"]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10050","city":"CS1019","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[48,26,69,65,78,58],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014602","helmet":"WP1013502"},"couple":["WJ10050"]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"名将吕布的正妻。随吕布入主徐州后，为吕布诞下一女。在全家被曹操围困于下邳期间，屡次反对陈宫计策，最终使得吕布放弃出逃计划，坚守城池直到被曹军攻陷。此役之后吕布被曹操处死，严氏与其女儿亦下落不明。","tc":"名將呂布的正妻。隨呂布入主徐州后，為呂布誕下一女。在全家被曹操圍困于下邳期間，屢次反對陳宮計策，最終使得呂布放棄出逃計劃，堅守城池直到被曹軍攻陷。此役之后呂布被曹操處死，嚴氏與其女兒亦下落不明。","en":"The principal wife of the renowned warrior Lu Bu. After Lu Bu took control of Xu Province, she bore him a daughter. During the siege of Xiapi by Cao Cao, she repeatedly opposed Chen Gong's strategies, ultimately persuading Lu Bu to abandon his escape plan and hold the city until it fell. Following the battle, Lu Bu was executed by Cao Cao, and the fate of Lady Yan and her daughter remains unknown.","jp":"名将・呂布の正妻。呂布に従って徐州に入った後、一女をもうけた。一家揃って下邳で曹操に包囲された際、陳宮の献策に度々反対し、結果として呂布に脱出計画を断念させ、曹操軍に攻め落とされるまで籠城を続けさせた。この戦いの後、呂布は曹操に処刑され、厳氏とその娘も行方知れずとなった。","kr":"명장 여포의 정실부인. 여포를 따라 서주에 들어간 뒤 딸 하나를 낳았다. 온 가족이 조조에게 하비에서 포위되었을 때 진궁의 계책을 거듭 반대하여, 결국 여포가 성을 빠져나갈 계획을 포기하고 농성하다가 조조군에게 함락당하게 만들었다. 이 전투 이후 여포는 조조에게 처형되었으며, 엄씨와 딸 역시 행방이 묘연해졌다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1000908","remark":"","surname":"严","surnameTc":"嚴","surnameEn":"Yan","surnameJp":"厳","surnameKr":"엄","surnameOther":"","name":"氏","nameTc":"氏","nameEn":"Shi","nameJp":"氏","nameKr":"씨","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"严氏","power":"WJ10048","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"190","city":"CS1028","gender":"1","rule":"48","force":"26","wise":"69","politics":"65","charm":"78","will":"58","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"9","politicsTalent":"10","charmTalent":"10","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"18/18/18/18/18/50/38/18","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"2600","battleSoulPoint":"800","debateSoulPoint":"4800","strategy":"","strategy2":"","professions":"0/0/0/0/0/1/0/0/3/0/0/0/0/1/1/0/0/3/0/1/0/2/2/2","attribute2":"56/30/76/72/78/60","morality":"3","compatible":"92","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"158","show":"184","death":"199","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"1","weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP101460